<title>Salima Transfert - Pour tous vos transactions</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
body{background:#f5f7fb;color:#222}
.header{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b8a3e,#0a5c2a);color:white;padding:28px 20px;text-align:center}
